{"schema_version":"1.0","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn10/","title":"취천 EX-HN10","language":"ko-KR","description":"경외기혈 취천의 위치·취혈·자침 정보를 정리합니다.","text":"취천 EX-HN10\n분류\n경외기혈 · 코드 EX-HN10\n위치\n舌의 背側 정중선의 중점.\n취혈\n혀를 내밀어서 背側面 정중선의 중점에서 취혈한다.\n자침·주의\n直刺 0.1～0.2寸\n舌强, 舌苔에는 點刺出血\n임상 연결\n경외기혈은 관련 부위·증상과 14경맥의 경혈을 함께 보고 배혈합니다.\n→ 경외기혈 통합 목록","headings":[{"level":2,"title":"분류","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn10/#_1"},{"level":2,"title":"위치","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn10/#_2"},{"level":2,"title":"취혈","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn10/#_3"},{"level":2,"title":"자침·주의","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn10/#_4"},{"level":2,"title":"임상 연결","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn10/#_5"}],"links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/"],"related_reading":[],"interpretation":"Public article text and navigation only; links do not establish clinical equivalence or treatment recommendations.","last_reviewed":"2026-08-22"}
